+# 16 KB pages by default.
+#
+# A guest page is a host mmap(), so the guest's page size cannot be smaller than
+# the host's -- a 4 KB guest simply cannot boot on a 16 KB host, and does so by
+# hanging rather than by failing. A 16 KB guest runs on both: four host pages
+# per guest page on a 4 KB host, one-to-one on a 16 KB one.
